Description: A searchable, filterable table of metadata on geodatasets that are
    useful for groundwater and environmental modelling. The metadata is kept as CSV
    files in this repository and rendered to a static web page with Quarto and
    reactable. This DESCRIPTION file only declares the dependencies of the build.
